Switch RetryTrigger "Wiederholungs-Auslöser"

Group RetryDevices "Geräte für Wiederholung"
Switch LightSwitch  "Wohnzimmerlicht" (RetryDevices)
Switch HeaterSwitch "Heizung"           (RetryDevices)
Switch FanSwitch    "Ventilator"        (RetryDevices)

Number RetryMaxAttempts      "Max. Versuche"        <number>
Number RetryInitialInterval  "Startintervall (s)"   <time>
Number RetryMaxInterval      "Max. Intervall (s)"    <time>
String RetryAlternativeAction "Alternative Aktion"
String NotificationItem "Letzte Alarmmeldung [%s]"
